\n\nVideo: https://t.co/PQ9fyHN2El"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 13025, "like_count": 65, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 25, "repost_count": 13}, "text": "The most important indicator for the health of the real economy is how wage growth compares to inflation.\n\nFor the first time since 2023 we're seeing prices in the US rise faster than wages, a decline in prosperity for the American worker.\n\nVideo: https://t.co/jzfV3ac8dL https://t.co/lE9K80pCNk", "url": "https://x.com/charliebilello/status/2114826693546287514"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114826067026309120"]}, "author_id": "60783724", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:06:41.000Z", "edit_history_post_ids": ["2114826070759289234"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/khRaPv7VvG", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ianbremmer/status/2114826070759289234/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114826067026309120", "start": 133, "url": "https://t.co/khRaPv7VvG"}]}, "id": "2114826070759289234", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 19511, "like_count": 200, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 33, "repost_count": 18}, "text": "has the leader of a nuclear power ever posted something like this? \n\nbut most important thing for the pm is that he stays in office. https://t.co/khRaPv7VvG", "url": "https://x.com/ianbremmer/status/2114826070759289234"}, {"author_id": "272019676", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:00:08.000Z", "edit_history_post_ids": ["2114824423257604192"], "id": "2114824423257604192", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "bit.ly/4iftUO0", "end": 323, "expanded_url": "https://bit.ly/4iftUO0", "start": 300, "url": "https://t.co/Kj0Nc7OpCt"}]}, "text": "Taiwan’s geographic position in Asia’s first island chain should not become the main reason why the U.S. supports Taiwan’s security. The main focus of U.S. policy should be preventing a PRC attack on Taiwan and the regional and global catastrophe it would cause, argues Thomas J. Ch