": "2114831025419288956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 862, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "repost_count": 2}, "text": "Some hot heat pumps here! @Princeton's large ground source heat pump building (with two integrated thermal energy storage tanks provide hours of demand flexibility visible at left). Clean, quiet, extremely efficient and looks nice in the glorious fall light. https://t.co/Y9sYkCVkmR", "url": "https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2114831025419288956"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114828848348950528"]}, "author_id": "19386622", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:17:45.000Z", "edit_history_post_ids": ["2114828854061588540"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 78, "start": 73, "tag": "UNSC"}], "mentions": [{"end": 36, "id": "2911144905", "start": 22, "username": "rafaelmgrossi"}, {"end": 55, "id": "14159148", "start": 52, "username": "UN"}], "urls": [{"description": "Non-proliferation - Security Council, 10253rd meeting", "display_url": "webtv.un.org/en/asset/k1j/k…", "end": 230, "expanded_url": "https://webtv.un.org/en/asset/k1j/k1j48hm4wh", "images": [{"height": 317, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114828854464335872/WxOIhMqu?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 564}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114828854464335872/WxOIhMqu?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 207, "status": 200, "title": "Non-proliferation - Security Council, 10253rd meeting", "unwound_url": "https://webtv.un.org/en/asset/k1j/k1j48hm4wh", "url": "https://t.co/BMnocPrVSl"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/f3CcvB8dc9", "end": 254, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2114828854061588540/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114828848348950528", "start": 231, "url": "https://t.co/f3CcvB8dc9"}]}, "id": "2114828854061588540", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1748, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "repost_count": 0}, "text": "IAEA Director General @rafaelmgrossi will brief the @UN Security Council #UNSC on current nuclear non-proliferation issues tomorrow, Tuesday 27 October, at 10AM New York time / 3PM Vienna time.\n\nWatch live: https://t.co/BMnocPrVSl https://t.co/f3CcvB8dc9", "url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2114828854061588540"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114827948523995136", "3_2114827948398170113", "3_2114827948385542144"]}, "author_id": "61559439", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:14:16.000Z", "edit_history_post_ids": ["2114827978748383342"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 103, "id": "932729913202880512", "start": 93, "username": "SimBioSys"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/mbzSeRnE8l", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114827978748383342/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114827948523995136", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/mbzSeRnE8l"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/mbzSeRnE8l", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114827978748383342/video/1", "media_key": "3_2114827948398170113", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/mbzSeRnE8l"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/mbzSeRnE8l", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114827978748383342/video/1", "media_key": "3_2114827948385542144", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/mbzSeRnE8l"}]}, "id": "2114827978748383342", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 103, "id": "932729913202880512", "start": 93, "username": "SimBioSys"}]}, "text": "After a breast cancer diagnosis, one of the hardest questions is whether it will come back.\n\n@SimBioSys is helping doctors and patients better understand that risk. Powered by NVIDIA technology, its FDA-cleared TumorSight Risk analyzes an existing breast MRI alongside pathology and clinical information to estimate the risk of cancer returning at five and ten years.\n\nFor women with HR-positive, HER2-negative early-stage breast cancer, those insights can be available before surgery, giving them and their doctors more information as they talk through treatment options.\n\nAI can help give patients and their doctors more information when the decisions ahead feel most difficult."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 11358, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 18, "repost_count": 12}, "text": "After a breast cancer diagnosis, one of the hardest questions is whether it will come back.\n\n@SimBioSys is helping doctors and patients better understand that risk. Powered by NVIDIA technology, its FDA-cleared TumorSight Risk analyzes an existing breast MRI alongside pathology https://t.co/mbzSeRnE8l", "url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114827978748383342"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114830685827379200"]}, "author_id": "46648807", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:25:02.000Z", "edit_history_post_ids": ["2114830689304543284"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The NBSB was established in 1979 at NIST in Gaithersburg, MD with a pilot project archiving human liver samples associated with collections through the Environmental Protection Agency (EPA). New collaborations and banking projects were established including the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Admin", "display_url": "nist.gov/programs-proje…", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://www.nist.gov/programs-projects/nist-biorepository", "images": [{"height": 416, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114830733114040322/Z7Y4jsF9?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 625}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114830733114040322/Z7Y4jsF9?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "The NIST Biorepository", "unwound_url": "https://www.nist.gov/programs-projects/nist-biorepository", "url": "https://t.co/TycWTIDUKk"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/YxLumGmEMB", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2114830689304543284/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114830685827379200", "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/YxLumGmEMB"}]}, "id": "2114830689304543284", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 403, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "repost_count": 0}, "text": "What looks like a witch’s cauldron is actually an ultracold freezer that holds marine animal tissue samples. This is part of the NIST Biorepository at the Hollings Marine Lab in Charleston, South Carolina. \n\nLearn more: https://t.co/TycWTIDUKk https://t.co/YxLumGmEMB", "url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2114830689304543284"}, {"author_id": "1945965464678498304", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:16:43.000Z", "edit_history_post_ids": ["2114828594581037169"], "id": "2114828594581037169", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 302, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "repost_count": 6}, "text": "This heat wan turn person to liquid \n\n           Latent heat of fusion", "url": "https://x.com/SHOLLY003/status/2114828594581037169"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114826767441821696"]}, "author_id": "1600613745453158401", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:09:30.000Z", "edit_history_post_ids": ["2114826777994617251"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/QsdwhPrG6e", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MoreBirths/status/2114826777994617251/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114826767441821696", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/QsdwhPrG6e"}, {"display_url": "x.com/cremieuxrecuei…", "end": 320, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/cremieuxrecueil/status/2114561938877448503", "start": 297, "url": "https://t.co/nkigw4YT3J"}]}, "id": "2114826777994617251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1571, "like_count": 63, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 4, "repost_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114561938877448503", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The list of ultra-low fertility countries is enormous and growing every year.\n\nReversing the trend of collapsing birthrates is the most important task of the 21st century and will require concerted efforts in culture, gender relations, housing, work-life balance and more. https://t.co/QsdwhPrG6e https://t.co/nkigw4YT3J", "url": "https://x.com/MoreBirths/status/2114826777994617251"}, {"author_id": "520445177", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:05:12.000Z", "edit_history_post_ids": ["2114825696807944583"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2114710124363182328", "start": 256, "url": "https://t.co/q2jBLjfaFR"}]}, "id": "2114825696807944583", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 10456, "like_count": 210, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 26, "repost_count": 18}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114710124363182328", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Fertility echo means it takes 20-25 years to recover an economy once birth rates are restored - and that’s not going to happen for decades, if ever  \n\nIt’s an unmitigated social and economic disaster for Japan and Europe. Only hope is androids + longevity https://t.co/q2jBLjfaFR", "url": "https://x.com/davidasinclair/status/2114825696807944583"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "497231011", "name": "China Beige Book", "username": "ChinaBeigeBook"}, {"id": "860158302", "name": "Quanta Magazine", "username": "QuantaMagazine"}, {"id": "15134240", "name": "NIH", "username": "NIH"}, {"id": "86626845", "name": "Eric Topol", "username": "EricTopol"}, {"id": "32372834", "name": "Science Magazine", "username": "ScienceMagazine"}, {"id": "3290364847", "name": "STAT", "username": "statnews"}, {"id": "487118986", "name": "China Xinhua News", "username": "XHNews"}, {"id": "23922797", "name": "South China Morning Post", "username": "SCMPNews"}, {"id": "272019676", "name": "CSIS", "username": "CSIS"}, {"id": "1413027896", "name": "Charlie Bilello", "username": "charliebilello"}, {"id": "60783724", "name": "ian bremmer", "username": "ianbremmer"}, {"id": "84679163", "name": "International Energy Agency", "username": "IEA"}, {"id": "17468569", "name": "Bryan Johnson", "username